:Namespace flash_attention

⎕IO ⎕CT←0

cases←(16384 64)(32768 64)(8192 128)(16384 128)

L2←{(0.5*⍨+⌿×⍨,⍵)-0.5*⍨×⌿⍺}

Q←⍬ ⋄ K←⍬ ⋄ V←⍬

attn←{(fx÷[0]+/fx←*S-[0]⌈/S←Q+.×⍉K)+.×V}

flash_attn←{M←⍺ ⍝ 2*23
	Qs←⍴Q ⋄ N←0⊃Qs ⋄ d←1⊃Qs ⋄ Br←d⌊Bc←⌈M÷4×d ⋄ Tr←⌈N÷Br ⋄ Tc←⌈N÷Bc
	Q←Tr Br d⍴Q ⋄ K←Tc Bc d⍴K ⋄ V←Tc Bc d⍴V
	O←Tr Br d⍴0.5-0.5 ⋄ l←Br⍴0.5-0.5 ⋄ m←Br⍴⌈⌿⍬
	_←{i←⍵ ⋄ Oi←O[i;;] ⋄ Qi←Q[i;;] ⋄ mi←Br⍴m ⋄ li←l
		O[i;;]←Oi⊣{j←⍵ ⋄ Kj←K[j;;] ⋄ Vj←V[j;;]
			mij←⌈/Sij←Qi+.×⍉Kj ⋄ lij←+/Pij←*Sij-[0]mij
			li∆←(eli←li×*mi-mi∆)+lij×eij←*mij-mi∆←mi⌈mij
			Oi⊢←li∆÷[0]⍨(eli×[0]Oi)+eij×[0]Pij+.×Vj
			li⊢←li∆ ⋄ mi⊢←mi∆	
		⍵+1}⍣Tc⊢0
	⍵+1}⍣Tr⊢0
	N d⍴O
}

Run←{N d←⍵⊃cases ⋄ ⍺←⊢ ⋄ M←⍺⊣2*23
	Q K V∘←N d∘⍴¨1 1 1
	Gflops←((N*2)×(4×d)+5)÷2*30
	
	⎕←'Running naive version...'
	
	start←24 60 60 1000⊥¯4↑⎕TS
	res←attn ⍬
	end←24 60 60 1000⊥¯4↑⎕TS
	⍝ ⎕←'Naive L2: ',⍕N d L2 res
	⎕←'Naive Attention time elapsed: ',(⍕time←(end-start)÷1000),'secs'
	⎕←(⍕d N),' Flash Attention throughput: ',(⍕Gflops÷time),' Gflops/sec'
		
	_←M kernel.flash_attn ⍬
	start←24 60 60 1000⊥¯4↑⎕TS
	res←M flash_attn ⍬
	end←24 60 60 1000⊥¯4↑⎕TS
	time←(end-start)÷1000
	⍝ ⎕←'Flash Attention L2: ',⍕N d L2 res
	⎕←'Flash Attention time elapsed: ',(⍕time),'secs'
	⎕←(⍕d N),' Flash Attention throughput: ',(⍕Gflops÷time),' Gflops/sec'
	
	1:shy←res
}

:EndNamespace